    },
    {
      "post_id": "553154533787201536",
      "text": ".@NiallODowd @Irish_Fart14 For Hitler ? Hitler of course being one of the greatest mass murderers in human history. No ? Of course you don't",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 11:41:32 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529279363248292e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552872715842224128",
      "text": "@HisEmineminence @joshglancy \noh God thats a stretch. What we need is a good satire on the Sudan famine right?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 17:01:41 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528699808372572e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552855064449404928",
      "text": "@joshglancy @RyanNewYork Of course they do, anyone who can't agree is just begging for more violence.",
