      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552862579639734272",
      "text": "@biepbot @joshglancy I don't. Personally.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:21:25 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528492974491771e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552880763595923457",
      "text": "@Irish_Fart14 @NiallODowd No. But I'm a grown up. I don't have to. By the same token, I wouldn't sign a petition to ban it, as has happened.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 17:33:40 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52880214100181e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552869500883058688",
      "text": "@NiallODowd @joshglancy is that no topic should be so venerated as to not be open to examination through song, drama, comedy etc. What",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:48:55 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5286665574403686e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552884140962762754",
      "text": "@Irish_Fart14 @NiallODowd No. If it's crap, it'll vanish anyway. If everybody loves it, I'll argue they're wrong. Banning is for dictators.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 17:47:05 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52882630308692e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552885937945206784",
      "text": "@Irish_Fart14 @NiallODowd Well, that's sad mate. I was always told to ignore bullies. Works the same for something you feel is offensive.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 17:54:14 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528843534671831e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552869137522130944",
      "text": "@NiallODowd @joshglancy Indeed. It's why I said \"and famines\", not \"including famines\". The point - as I'm sure your clever enough to grasp,",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:47:28 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5286665574403686e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552886163703615489",
      "text": "@Irish_Fart14 @NiallODowd Ignore it. Nobody thinks the famine is funny in itself. Not for a second. But, who knows, they could write",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 17:55:08 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528843534671831e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552859973047549954",
      "text": "@joshglancy @johntmarohn How many Muslim leaders are condemning these murders?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:11:03 +0000 2015",
