      "parent_id": 5.531561067266867e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552886501282152448",
      "text": "@Irish_Fart14 @NiallODowd something funny around it. Or maybe it'll be complete shite. But I'd defend the writer's right to try with every",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 17:56:28 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528843534671831e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552878065421139968",
      "text": "@NiallODowd @joshglancy And in a democracy a writer is free to write what they like &amp; you're free to not like it. But wait til it's written.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 17:22:57 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528727158422241e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553156106726686720",
      "text": "@NiallODowd @Irish_Fart14 @HisEmineminence  And 100,000 lemmings can't be wrong.",
